          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Trouble falling asleep, especially after late or night shifts; wakes a few times thinking about work. Gets about 4–5 hours on work days and sleeps a bit better on days off."
      }
    },
