          "text": "Weight change"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports a possible 2–3 kg weight loss over approximately 6 months, which she thinks may be due to skipped meals at work; no weight loss of concern reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
